 <h3>2. #UI inside a macro</h3>
 <p>
 </p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>load</var>
   = 10
   <span class="dvc">
    <i>kN</i>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <i>m</i>
   </span>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>M</var>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>load</var>
    · 6
    <i>m</i>
    <sup class="unit">2</sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    8
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    10
    <i>kN</i>
    <i class="unit">∕</i>
    <i>m</i>
    · 6
    <i>m</i>
    <sup class="unit">2</sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    8
   </span>
   = 7.5
   <i>kNm</i>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>Midspan moment for span = 6 and load = 10 is M = 7.5</p>
 <p>
 </p>
 <h3>3. #UI inside conditionals and loops</h3>
